	<name>2190 Shattuck Ave · 452 units · In Review · loop</name>
	<description><![CDATA[Standalone building loop, generated by scripts/gen_building_loop.py. Plan view 330 m -> spiral -> 1.2 turns -> eye level 120 m at radius 143 m. Altitudes derive from this building's extrusion height (110.0 m), so a corrected height re-cuts the shot. Load alongside geometry.kml.]]></description>
